# ============================================================================
# Trading flash cards — hourly push notifications, broad curriculum
# ============================================================================
# Bite-sized education that fires every hour 8 AM - 8 PM ET on weekdays.
# Cards rotate through nine topic pools — each hour maps to ONE topic,
# the specific card within a topic cycles by day-of-year. See the
# HOURLY_TOPIC dict in backend/flashcards/flashcards.py for the full
# hour-to-topic schedule.
#
# Topics covered (9 pools, ~80 cards total):
#   * entry / risk / sell_rules / psychology / review (Minervini)
#   * fundamentals — EPS, P/E vs PEG, FCF, ROIC, book value, equity types
#                    (added 2026-05-21: user asked about "company equity
#                    vs shareholder equity" gap)
#   * market_structure — T+1, dark pools, LULD bands, NBBO, Greeks, halts
