#                (the "fun facts traders get stoked by" pool)
#   * edge_math — expectancy, Kelly, drawdown math, compounding, R-multiples
#
# Single cron entry — the script itself decides whether to fire based on
# the current hour (no-op outside the populated window). Beats 13
# separate cron lines and the schedule lives in one place (the Python).
#
# User can mute via /notifications → "Minervini flash cards" toggle.
# Default ON for new subscriptions. NOTE: pref key kept as
# "minervini_flashcards" for backward compat with existing subscriptions —
# the label in the UI may be renamed but the key shouldn't move.
