# Manual ad-hoc fires for testing:
#   docker compose exec cron python -m flashcards.flashcards hourly
#   docker compose exec cron python -m flashcards.flashcards history     # any topic
#   docker compose exec cron python -m flashcards.flashcards fundamentals
#
# Every hour, EVERY day (weekends too — education isn't time-zone-locked).
# The HOURLY_TOPIC map in flashcards.py covers 0-23 so every fire has a
# valid topic. Quiet-hours pref (per-user, default 22:00-08:00 if enabled)
# suppresses delivery during the user's chosen sleep window — see
